is named, not shipped. The reference informed the shape of the switcher kernel
only: which plane owns a fact, when a window list is read, where the default
highlight lands, when a highlight becomes a commitment, and how a grid of tiles
wraps, centers its short rows and settles on a size. Every line of it is a
structural port recorded in ATTRIBUTION.md.

alt-tab-macos is not a dependency. It is not built, not linked and not required to
build, test or ship CrossOS.
